<title>USA: Las Vegas, Nev., won by Robert Baird.</title>
<headline>Las Vegas, Nev., won by Robert Baird.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robert W. Baird said it won $10.500 million of Las Vegas, Nev., general obligation recreation limited tax bonds, Series Feb.1, 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.7985 percent.</p>
</text>
